+# ELXVRO Blocks v0.37.6 — Reliable Online Scores
+
+Based on the complete v0.37.5 Flutter source, retaining its three independent
+Play Games rankings, compact navigation, assets and five-world Adventure mode.
+
+## Changes
+
+1. **Offline score protection:** before sending a high score to Google Play
+   Games, keep the pending score in local preferences. If authentication or
+   submission fails, the saved score is retried on a later successful sign-in.
+2. **Record coalescing:** pending scores are keyed by the actual Play Games
+   leaderboard ID; only the highest pending score is retained for each table.
+   Async writes and retry flushes are serialized across service instances.
+3. **Safe remote acknowledgments:** a pending result is removed only after the
+   Play Games submission completes; an offline or interrupted submission does
+   not erase it. Local scores are **not** displayed as online player rankings.
+4. **Correct weekly score for Falling Blocks:** upload the actual *current
+   session's* score, not the lifetime-best score. This avoids artificially
+   inserting an old record into the weekly ranking.
+5. **Adventure score bounds:** the five-world campaign completion score sent
+   to its leaderboard is clamped to 0–300 unique completed stages.
+6. Regression tests cover offline preservation, retry after a new service
+   instance, maximum-score coalescing, independent leaderboards and failures.
+
+## Google Play Games configuration
+
+To activate all three remote rankings, supply **real and published** IDs through
+`--dart-define=ELXVRO_PG_CLASSIC_LEADERBOARD_ID=...`,
+`--dart-define=ELXVRO_PG_FALLING_BLOCKS_LEADERBOARD_ID=...` and
+`--dart-define=ELXVRO_PG_WORLD_ADVENTURE_LEADERBOARD_ID=...`.
+
+Remote accounts/signing credentials and Play Games services tester access must
+be verified on real devices before distribution. Pending scores are kept in
+this app installation, not an online account backup. A different Play Games
+account on the same installation can receive pending scores if the account
+changes before synchronization; avoid account switching before sync.
+
+## Validation scope
+
+The archive contains source and Flutter tests. A verified signed APK/AAB is
+not included; building requires Flutter and Android SDK plus the existing
+release-signing configuration.
